### get all course
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/courses/


### get one course
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/courses/2/


### Create course
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/courses/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Django",
    "description": "learn Django framework to become a fully fledged backend developer",
    "teacher_id": 13
}

### update course
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/courses/2/update/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Django",
    "description": "learn Django framework to become a fully fledged backend developer",
    "teacher_id": 12
}

### delete user
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/6/remove/